---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Operating Commitments" backLabel="About" backHref="/about">
  <section class="mt-8 max-w-[820px] space-y-6">
    <div>
      <div class="inline-block pl-2.5 border-l-2 border-[#0F766E] text-[13px] font-medium text-[#525866]">
        Principles &amp; access
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display mt-2 text-[30px] sm:text-[36px] font-bold tracking-[-0.025em] text-[#161A22]">
        Operating commitments
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-[#525866]">
        How TF Unions protects equal educational access and data independence across Egypt.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#DFDDD6] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(22,26,34,0.04)]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[19px] font-semibold text-[#161A22]">Every educational track included</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525866]">
          Thanaweya Amma, STEM High Schools, IGCSE, American Diploma, Al-Azhar, Preparatory schools, and universities share identical free access.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#DFDDD6] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(22,26,34,0.04)]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[19px] font-semibold text-[#161A22]">Built for long-term memory</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525866]">
          Research blueprinted by alumni cohorts remains online permanently so each incoming class starts ahead of the previous one.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-white border border-[#DFDDD6] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(22,26,34,0.04)] divide-y divide-[#EAE8E1]">
      <div class="py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#161A22]">Ambition over examination cutoffs</div>
          <div class="text-[13.5px] text-[#525866] mt-0.5">Opportunity access is determined by curiosity, build logs, and initiative rather than geography or school track.</div>
        </div>
        <span class="font-code text-[12px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#EAE8E1] border border-[#DCD9D0] text-[#525866] shrink-0">01</span>
      </div>
      <div class="py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#161A22]">Zero recurring commercial SaaS lock-in</div>
          <div class="text-[13.5px] text-[#525866] mt-0.5">Databases, analytics, and automated workflows run on dedicated Linux containers controlled by the union.</div>
        </div>
        <span class="font-code text-[12px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#EAE8E1] border border-[#DCD9D0] text-[#525866] shrink-0">02</span>
      </div>
      <div class="py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#161A22]">Verifiable public accountability</div>
          <div class="text-[13.5px] text-[#525866] mt-0.5">Volunteer certificates carry public serials and all inflows/outflows are audited on the Open Ledger.</div>
        </div>
        <span class="font-code text-[12px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#EAE8E1] border border-[#DCD9D0] text-[#525866] shrink-0">03</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
